            "review_title": "Review at Bottega Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Paradise35160962757\n3 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem\nJul 2025 • Business\nsuch an amazing experience. I ordered pasta and cold cuts plate and both are super good!!!!!!!!!!! They are like a food shop where u can buy some cheese and cold cuts, wine, dry pasta,etc and also serve food. I was too full but I will come back tomorrow cuz their Focaccia and Ciabatta look so good, I was watching them make sandwiches for other customers...... looked incredible. Portion here is big, fresh ingredients!!!!!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nu can visit anytime cuz they open from 8:30-22:00. In compare to other restaurants in this area, price is very very very good!!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 15, 2025",
